<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS4" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ NP-Engine: Empowering Optimization Reasoning in Large Language Models with Verifiable Synthetic NP Problems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.4 </span>NP-hard Tasks</span></a>
