<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A1.SS4.SSS4" title="In A.4 NP-hard Tasks ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ NP-Engine: Empowering Optimization Reasoning in Large Language Models with Verifiable Synthetic NP Problems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.4.4 </span>Balanced Minimum Bisection</span></a></li>
